---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import HeroHeader from "../../components/HeroHeader.astro";
const pagePath = "/privacy/blockshift/";
---
<BaseLayout title="BLOCKSHIFT Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for BLOCKSHIFT: offline puzzle gameplay, local saves and optional haptics. No accounts, ads, purchases or analytics in the internal-test edition." canonicalPath={pagePath}>
  <HeroHeader eyebrow="BLOCKSHIFT" title="BLOCKSHIFT Privacy Policy" tagline="Offline puzzle gameplay and local progress, with no account or tracking in the internal-test edition." />
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Privacy", href: "/privacy/" }, { label: "BLOCKSHIFT" }]} />
  <section class="content-card" aria-label="Policy applicability"><p class="eyebrow">Effective 17 October 2026</p><p>Offline internal-test edition, version 0.5.0.</p></section>
<section class="content-card" aria-labelledby="blockshift-1">
  <h2 id="blockshift-1">Who provides the game</h2>
  <p>BLOCKSHIFT is an offline single-player Android puzzle game provided by Andrei Olaru, trading as Made by Kreativ. This policy covers package <code>com.madebykreativ.blockshift</code>. Contact: <a href="mailto:info@madebykreativ.com">info@madebykreativ.com</a>.</p>
</section>
<section class="content-card" aria-labelledby="blockshift-2">
  <h2 id="blockshift-2">No collection through the game</h2>
  <p>This edition does not collect or share your gameplay data with the developer or third parties. It has no account, server connection, analytics, crash-reporting, advertising or purchase SDK. It requests no internet permission. Google Play and Android may independently process store or operating-system information under their own policies; that is not information transmitted by the game to Made by Kreativ.</p>
</section>
<section class="content-card" aria-labelledby="blockshift-3">
  <h2 id="blockshift-3">Local records and retention</h2>
  <p>Scores, statistics, settings, Daily Challenge history and one saved board per game mode are retained in private storage on your device until you reset or remove them. The game uses checksummed files and recovery copies to recover interrupted writes. These records are not sent to Made by Kreativ. Android app backup is disabled in this edition.</p>
</section>
<section class="content-card" aria-labelledby="blockshift-4">
  <h2 id="blockshift-4">Removing your data</h2>
  <p>Settings → About → Privacy &amp; local data → Reset local progress removes your scores, Daily history and saved boards while keeping preferences. Restore default settings resets preferences while keeping tutorial completion and game progress. Android's clear-app-storage controls or uninstall remove the installation's local app data. The game has no account or developer-operated cloud copy to delete. Reinstalling starts fresh.</p>
</section>
<section class="content-card" aria-labelledby="blockshift-5">
  <h2 id="blockshift-5">Permissions</h2>
  <p>The optional VIBRATE permission provides local haptic feedback. Turn it off in the game's Settings. The game does not request location, camera, microphone, contacts, shared-storage or network access.</p>
</section>
<section class="content-card" aria-labelledby="blockshift-6">
  <h2 id="blockshift-6">Support email and website links</h2>
  <p>If you contact us by email, we receive the information you choose to send and use it to respond and handle your request. Do not send sensitive information or payment-card details. Request deletion of support correspondence by emailing the same address; any information that must be retained for a legal obligation is handled under that obligation.</p><p>Support links open your email app. Website links open your browser. The game does not attach boards, scores, identifiers or other gameplay records to those links. Your email provider, browser and the destination website handle those interactions under their own policies. Hosting and network providers receive the technical request information needed to serve this policy page. See the <a href="https://madebykreativ.com/privacy/">Made by Kreativ website privacy policy</a> for website processing.</p>
</section>
<section class="content-card" aria-labelledby="blockshift-7">
  <h2 id="blockshift-7">Changes</h2>
  <p>This policy describes the offline internal-test edition. We will update it and the applicable store disclosures before enabling advertising, analytics or purchases. The date above identifies this policy revision.</p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
